  "body": "Positioned proudly on a sunny 261sqm (approx.) corner site, this beautifully designed two-storey residence delivers the perfect balance of modern comfort, natural light, and effortless family living. With a thoughtfully planned 174sqm (approx.) floor area, every space within the home has been carefully crafted to create warmth, functionality, and a welcoming sense of privacy.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, you are greeted by a sense of openness and calm. Bathed in natural sunlight, the open-plan kitchen and dining area create a warm and welcoming space. The modern kitchen is beautifully appointed with quality finishes, sleek cabinetry, and ample bench space, forming the heart of the home where family and friends can naturally gather. Positioned alongside, the separate lounge offers a versatile retreat for cozy movie nights, hosting guests, or simply unwinding in comfort at the end of the day, with seamless access to the sunny outdoor deck for effortless indoor-outdoor enjoyment. The seperate lounge can also be used as an additional bedroom, offering extra flexibility for the home. \r\n\r\nAdding further practicality to the ground floor is a full bathroom, perfect for guests or extended family, while the single internal-access garage with laundry nook ensures daily living remains organized and effortless.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four generously proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation for the whole family. The master suite offers a private haven of relaxation, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a stylish ensuite designed for comfort and convenience. The remaining bedrooms are serviced by a beautifully appointed family bathroom with a bathtub, perfectly suited for children, guests, a home office, or creative spaces.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nCentral air-conditioning\r\nIntercom\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly desirable Silverdale community, this home places you moments from everything you need. Enjoy easy walking access to Hibiscus Coast Station, Park & Ride, along with convenient proximity to Pak'nSave Silverdale, Silverdale Mall, KingsWay School, Northern Arena, local cafés, and parks. Excellent motorway connections ensure an effortless commute, while the setting offers the perfect balance of suburban peace and modern convenience-an ideal lifestyle for today's families.\r\n\r\nThe advantages of corner-site living bring enhanced sunlight, added privacy, and an elevated sense of space - creating a home that feels both bright and uniquely your own.\r\n\r\nWhether you are searching for a modern family home, a peaceful retreat, or a smart investment in a fast-growing location, this exceptional property is one you won't want to miss.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and experience everything this stunning Silverdale home has to offer.",
